# Never-commit artifacts that kept surfacing as "untracked, never committed" in cross-repo
# audits (2026-09-04). None of these are work-in-progress -- they are large generated data,
# binary wheels, or agent/tool scratch. Listing them here is what stops a future audit from
# re-flagging them as unlanded work.
# NB: .gitignore has no inline comments -- a trailing "# ..." becomes part of the pattern and
# silently matches nothing, which is exactly how the first version of this block failed.

# TimeseriesDB (2.8 GB SQLite), canonical per CLAUDE.md -- never in git
data/
# generated statistical_analysis output
stats/
# generated audit render
audit_board.png
# locally built wheels (onnxruntime_migraphx, xformers: ~30 MB)
*.whl
# agent / browser tool scratch
.playwright-mcp/
.superpowers/
